{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16998","headline":"闻相公三兄小园置宴以元衡寓直因寄上兼呈中书三兄 · 武元衡","name":"闻相公三兄小园置宴以元衡寓直因寄上兼呈中书三兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休沐限中禁，家山传胜游。\n露寒潘省夜，木落庾园秋。\n兰菊回幽步，壶觞洽旧俦。\n位高天禄阁，词异畔牢愁。\n孤思琴先觉，驰晖水竞流。\n明朝不相见，清祀在圜丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}